                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4d73da9-337b-3c3d-85cd-94f887919d89",
                        "entry_id": "3b087365-b797-3ba7-a6e7-44bb3c5fe29b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or relating to performance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2055050-aae0-4f52-a544-3dbf31d7cf0e",
                                "sense_id": "a4d73da9-337b-3c3d-85cd-94f887919d89",
                                "text": "A ballet visibly stresses the performant function even though, traditionally, it also claims to communicate some meaning. In sports, the performant function dominates more openly; but, in a symbiotic relation, it derives much of its vitality from a grafted referential function that operates through cultural signs. [...] As a rule, however, the performant function, when it is supported by truly impressive circus performances, tends to monopolize the audience's attention."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "638336a0-422c-39fc-8599-f8d663eb39fb",
                        "entry_id": "3b087365-b797-3ba7-a6e7-44bb3c5fe29b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Performing well; Capable of or characterized by a high or excellent level of performance or efficiency."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b520434f-43fc-4247-acb4-024453783003",
                                "sense_id": "638336a0-422c-39fc-8599-f8d663eb39fb",
                                "text": "The inhabitants commonly use pacing Naggs, singularly performant in travaille, and easily kept in good case."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17329c90-3d86-4bd3-a704-0824ebe8c518",
                                "sense_id": "638336a0-422c-39fc-8599-f8d663eb39fb",
                                "text": "Nevertheless, it should be realized that most of the trials were conducted with poorly performant neutron installations (similar to old 200 kV X-ray units)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e3f10cd-36c1-4ec9-90e6-edffeb0026bd",
                                "sense_id": "638336a0-422c-39fc-8599-f8d663eb39fb",
                                "text": "Within the Columbus program, the studies defining and optimizing the pressurized spaces must be based on extremely rigorous and highly performant modular and repetitive geometric dimensions, in compliance with ergonomic data inherent to the indispensable presence of man."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1db7a63-a7d9-4952-92ed-5dd9f231cdd8",
                                "sense_id": "638336a0-422c-39fc-8599-f8d663eb39fb",
                                "text": "Results suggest that shear actuators can be more performant than extension ones for the control of bending operations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc4b64dc-2aa0-4399-ba59-844af294998f",
                                "sense_id": "638336a0-422c-39fc-8599-f8d663eb39fb",
                                "text": "In our energy-conscious society, materials and structures are required to be more performant, lightweight, and cheap."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                        "entry_id": "3b087365-b797-3ba7-a6e7-44bb3c5fe29b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Performing well; Capable of or characterized by a high or excellent level of performance or efficiency.",
                            "Characterized by a level of performance or efficiency that is adequate for or exceeds the expectations of end users."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf1f4d98-bf94-48ff-a340-594ee37fd3d5",
                                "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                                "text": "The program ALGOLOG is highly performant: it generated 259 linear subproblems, instead of 2²³."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c028163b-9f64-4f54-934f-986144cb3e7b",
                                "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                                "text": "Recently, a pure view-based object recognition approach was proposed, that is surprisingly performant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62e304dd-ceea-481b-9a9c-cd46face8acc",
                                "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                                "text": "There are strong arguments that some features of J2EE, such as entity beans, can never be as performant in many situations as some alternatives."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "404a0676-3314-4772-8ec0-9def839f293c",
                                "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                                "text": "Yahoo uses YUI in their products, and as a result it is highly performant and well-tested."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "222dc906-445b-490c-91c6-240fceb26e8a",
                                "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                                "text": "While we can run a plethora of tools against our code to check its quality in advance, there really is no substitute for running that code within a web browser to ensure not only that it runs correctly but also that it is performant and memory-efficient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dee845d5-a3de-410a-9dad-5c78473c0361",
                                "sense_id": "d6123e87-2d84-3fec-9039-f990ab9f0ebe",
                                "text": "To keep the computational requirements within the reach of even aged and low-performant personal computers, computationally intensive operations are avoided."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
